WEBVTT

00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:16.203
Pony's home, which was to be
disbanded in the spring,

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:20.336
...would remain forever as it is,
thanks to Candy's efforts.

00:00:21.352 --> 00:00:25.081
The land owner, mr. Cartwright,
allowed them to continue using his land.

00:00:37.333 --> 00:00:44.668
Scar on the healed soul.

00:00:59.943 --> 00:01:01.063
There it is!

00:01:03.665 --> 00:01:04.352
It got away!

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.059
Wait!

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:19.340
-Boss!
-Candy will catch it for sure!

00:01:27.649 --> 00:01:28.794
Boss?

00:01:29.203 --> 00:01:30.865
I got you!

00:01:31.455 --> 00:01:35.123
-Boss, but the rabbit is over there!
-It's okay this way!

00:01:36.672 --> 00:01:39.719
Don't pick on poor animals.
Now, everybody, come!

00:01:40.932 --> 00:01:41.851
Boss!

00:01:54.842 --> 00:01:59.028
Sister Pony, I haven't heard anything
from the Adley family but...

00:01:59.063 --> 00:02:01.626
...will Candy be okay like this?

00:02:02.066 --> 00:02:07.898
I'm sure Adleys have decided to leave
Candy alone a bit until she recovers...

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:12.353
In that case, that's good, but...
What are Candy's plans?

00:02:15.417 --> 00:02:18.992
It seems that she doesn't think
what to do from now on...

00:02:19.726 --> 00:02:21.726
-Is it okay?
-It's okay!

00:02:22.321 --> 00:02:26.399
Okay?
Take a good look at my lasso skills!

00:02:33.551 --> 00:02:35.312
That's great, boss!

00:02:35.402 --> 00:02:38.298
I'll do it again, so pay attention!

00:02:40.262 --> 00:02:44.351
-Hey!
-Mr. Matthew!

00:02:45.878 --> 00:02:48.378
Boss, you did it again!

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:51.553
Good day, mr. Matthew.

00:02:52.620 --> 00:02:54.658
Candy, here's a letter from Tom.

00:02:55.483 --> 00:02:56.814
From Tom?

00:02:57.875 --> 00:02:58.861
Who is Tom?

00:02:59.543 --> 00:03:03.640
A successor of the Steve farm...
He got adopted from here.

00:03:03.846 --> 00:03:09.502
-And now he's become a great cowboy!
-He's very devoted to his work.

00:03:10.285 --> 00:03:13.102
He was from Pony's home... amazing!

00:03:13.322 --> 00:03:16.329
Jimmy, you too could get adopted
to some good place!

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:22.076
I'm not going anywhere.
I'll stay with boss.

00:03:22.322 --> 00:03:23.284
Jimmy.

00:03:24.035 --> 00:03:30.826
Candy, you can stay here forever.
You don't have to return to Lakewood, right?

00:03:31.018 --> 00:03:32.259
Yes...

00:03:32.482 --> 00:03:34.404
You'd be lonely again...

00:03:36.131 --> 00:03:38.194
Mr. Matthew, aren't you going
to take a break?

00:03:38.395 --> 00:03:41.664
I still have a few letters to deliver.
See you again!

00:03:42.917 --> 00:03:44.525
Goodbye, mr. Matthew!

00:03:44.929 --> 00:03:48.498
Boss, about you going back to Lakewood...
That's not true, right?

00:03:48.838 --> 00:03:50.228
It's not true.

00:03:50.407 --> 00:03:53.015
Then you'll stay here forever, right?

00:03:53.421 --> 00:03:54.209
Yes.

00:03:56.041 --> 00:04:00.151
That's right. I left the Adley family
with no intent of ever comimg back.

00:04:02.665 --> 00:04:06.841
Stear, Archie,
I'm going to strike out on my own.

00:04:07.585 --> 00:04:12.090
Please, forgive me for leaving without seeing
you, but it would've been too painful that way.

00:04:14.945 --> 00:04:16.800
-Boss!
-Huh?

00:04:17.725 --> 00:04:22.245
-What does Tom say?
-Read it to us!

00:04:22.609 --> 00:04:23.898
That's right!

00:04:26.418 --> 00:04:27.682
So what did he write?

00:04:27.966 --> 00:04:31.410
He invites us to to his farm tommorrow!

00:04:31.822 --> 00:04:35.063
-Great!
-Everyone, get prepared!

00:04:38.580 --> 00:04:40.741
Alright. You can go!

00:04:45.021 --> 00:04:46.246
Candy?

00:04:47.475 --> 00:04:48.926
I'm sorry!

00:04:52.926 --> 00:04:55.644
However, only big kids can go!

00:04:57.784 --> 00:04:59.258
Sister Pony?

00:04:59.382 --> 00:05:05.803
Candy, it's a long walk to Tom's farm!
Little kids couldn't manage that.

00:05:05.897 --> 00:05:09.648
In all, you'd be too tired to have fun.

00:05:10.008 --> 00:05:12.435
No, I want to go!

00:05:13.828 --> 00:05:15.587
Take us along!

00:05:21.857 --> 00:05:25.461
Sister Pony, sister Lane,
I can take everybody along!

00:05:26.319 --> 00:05:27.831
But Candy...

00:05:28.249 --> 00:05:30.514
-Wait for me!
-Candy!

00:05:32.181 --> 00:05:33.718
Boss!

00:05:47.686 --> 00:05:50.351
That's it, we'll ask mr. Cartwright!

00:05:52.225 --> 00:05:54.927
-A cart would be okay?
-Yes!

00:05:55.141 --> 00:05:56.820
Alright, I'll let you have it.

00:05:57.318 --> 00:05:59.658
Thank you, mr. Cartwright!

00:06:00.295 --> 00:06:01.758
This is great, boss!

00:06:03.115 --> 00:06:06.914
Candy, you said you're
a widow from Pony's home, right?

00:06:07.131 --> 00:06:07.763
Yes.

00:06:08.187 --> 00:06:10.919
So would you care to
become my daughter then?

00:06:11.147 --> 00:06:12.675
What? Your daughter?

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:14.920
You're somebody I could rely on.

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:17.942
But I...

00:06:18.327 --> 00:06:22.723
You don't need to answer immediately!
Candy, give it some thought.

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:25.153
I will.

00:06:32.828 --> 00:06:35.939
Boss, why didn't you agree rightaway?

00:06:36.504 --> 00:06:39.870
To become his daughter... that's amazing!

00:06:41.129 --> 00:06:44.649
Maybe I could even become happy like Tom.

00:06:45.309 --> 00:06:48.867
That's right! There's nothing wrong
about being a girl-cowboy!

00:06:50.729 --> 00:06:52.562
That's right. But I can't do that.

00:06:52.597 --> 00:06:53.657
Why?

00:06:54.082 --> 00:06:58.776
Abandoning Adley family and becoming
Cartwright's daughter instead...

00:06:58.953 --> 00:07:00.259
I couldn't really do that!

00:07:00.852 --> 00:07:02.831
It sounds pretty good though...

00:07:03.059 --> 00:07:06.083
I think there are other ways
for me to live.

00:07:06.558 --> 00:07:07.721
What do you mean?

00:07:08.341 --> 00:07:11.458
I don't really know yet.

00:07:33.471 --> 00:07:35.369
Now, everybody, get in the carriage!

00:07:39.007 --> 00:07:42.472
-Candy, can you really manage them alone?
-Yeah!

00:07:42.623 --> 00:07:47.374
We'd go along, but unfortunately,
we are too busy...

00:07:49.323 --> 00:07:54.614
Leave it to me, sister Pony! I have
experience from my voyage to Mexico!

00:07:54.852 --> 00:07:57.144
-Are you guys all in?
-Yeah!

00:07:58.284 --> 00:08:02.642
-Everyone, listen to Candy!
-Yeah!

00:08:02.859 --> 00:08:06.526
-Well then, Candy, take care!
-Yes!

00:08:07.300 --> 00:08:11.162
Send our regards to Tom!
I will! See you then!

00:08:15.734 --> 00:08:17.865
See you! Take care!

00:08:22.868 --> 00:08:26.226
Sister Pony, the children are so happy!

00:08:26.261 --> 00:08:30.476
That's right! They have never been
on a trip before!

00:09:46.216 --> 00:09:48.567
Hey, I see Tom's farm!

00:09:54.741 --> 00:09:55.976
Candy!

00:09:56.198 --> 00:09:58.283
It's Tom!
Tom!

00:10:08.530 --> 00:10:10.816
Tom! Tom!

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:22.020
Candy!

00:10:23.952 --> 00:10:25.651
Tom, long time no see!

00:10:25.773 --> 00:10:27.287
-You're in high spirits!
-Yeah.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.386
Everyone, you got here well?

00:10:31.807 --> 00:10:33.213
What... what happened?

00:10:34.061 --> 00:10:38.061
She forgot that we were riding in the back!

00:10:38.666 --> 00:10:41.835
-Sorry!
-You haven't changed at all, Candy!

00:10:43.975 --> 00:10:46.776
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Come to think of it, I'd really like to hear
Shimon Masato singing the CC theme song.

00:10:48.053 --> 00:10:49.936
Hello, Candy!

00:10:50.869 --> 00:10:52.346
Good day, mr. Steve.

00:10:53.048 --> 00:10:56.007
I heard what a horrible thing
happened to Anthony...

00:10:57.524 --> 00:10:58.898
Dad!

00:11:00.692 --> 00:11:04.160
It's okay, Tom. I'm alright with that.

00:11:04.332 --> 00:11:07.747
That's good. You can't keep crying
over him forever!

00:11:08.156 --> 00:11:12.120
That's great!
Now let me introduce you to other guests!

00:11:12.422 --> 00:11:13.826
Other guests?

00:11:14.431 --> 00:11:16.218
Hi, miss Tomboy!

00:11:17.731 --> 00:11:18.802
BOO.

00:11:19.171 --> 00:11:20.894
Stear! Archie!

00:11:22.023 --> 00:11:23.932
We wanted to see you, Candy!

00:11:34.081 --> 00:11:35.161
Hey, Candy...

00:11:35.379 --> 00:11:39.359
We didn't come all the way here
to see you in sorrow!

00:11:41.063 --> 00:11:43.177
No, it's not that...

00:11:43.212 --> 00:11:44.737
I just got so nostalgic...

00:11:44.924 --> 00:11:46.305
So these tears are from nostalgia...

00:11:46.340 --> 00:11:47.648
If that's the case, great!

00:11:47.837 --> 00:11:51.803
Tom encouraged you to come, Candy,
and invited us here as well.

00:11:52.647 --> 00:11:54.096
Tom, thank you.

00:11:55.239 --> 00:11:59.938
Candy, at first, we thought that it
could unnecessarily sadden you...

00:11:59.973 --> 00:12:01.936
...if you expected us coming to see you.

00:12:02.132 --> 00:12:03.144
But I'm glad we came.

00:12:03.202 --> 00:12:05.776
I'm happy to see you, too.

00:12:08.003 --> 00:12:14.021
Now, everybody, are you thirsty?
It's fresh milk! Have some!

00:12:17.319 --> 00:12:20.154
Wait! You can't pig out like that!

00:12:20.952 --> 00:12:24.263
Now, everybody, take a cup and
you can get a round!

00:12:24.504 --> 00:12:25.810
Yes!

00:12:38.797 --> 00:12:43.653
-Candy, I'm so glad you recovered.
-Now we don't have to worry anymore!

00:12:44.068 --> 00:12:48.824
But I... I have absolutely no idea
as to what should I do from now on.

00:12:49.269 --> 00:12:52.710
No need to hurry.
That's right! You just recovered!

00:12:53.004 --> 00:12:54.968
Take it easy, the world can wait a bit!

00:12:56.090 --> 00:12:57.474
Boss, have some!

00:12:57.791 --> 00:13:01.317
Boss? Candy, you're already the boss?

00:13:01.489 --> 00:13:03.064
Huh? Yeah...

00:13:04.508 --> 00:13:05.791
That's a good one!

00:13:09.974 --> 00:13:13.114
I haven't laughed like this
in a long time...

00:13:19.131 --> 00:13:20.490
Hey, everybody!

00:13:21.376 --> 00:13:23.273
Take a look at this horse!

00:13:25.445 --> 00:13:27.025
Now that's a great horse!

00:13:27.347 --> 00:13:29.391
It was Tom who trained it.

00:13:30.659 --> 00:13:33.769
Amazing! You're a real cowboy, Tom!

00:13:33.804 --> 00:13:34.840
Show us what it can do!

00:13:35.368 --> 00:13:36.042
Alright!

00:13:38.469 --> 00:13:40.354
Wow, he's cool!

00:13:40.937 --> 00:13:42.997
Want to see a rodeo?

00:14:04.154 --> 00:14:05.452
Anthony!

00:14:07.683 --> 00:14:09.486
Anthony!

00:14:16.309 --> 00:14:18.387
Anthony!

00:14:21.492 --> 00:14:22.462
Candy!

00:14:22.702 --> 00:14:26.162
Stop it! Stop it!

00:14:27.870 --> 00:14:29.726
-Candy!
-Wait, Archie!

00:14:30.117 --> 00:14:31.840
-Wait.
-Why did you stop me?

00:14:32.153 --> 00:14:34.038
It would be better if we left
her alone a bit.

00:14:35.279 --> 00:14:37.005
Candy... I'm sorry.

00:14:39.945 --> 00:14:43.126
Anthony! Anthony!

00:14:45.978 --> 00:14:47.553
Anthony!

00:14:51.047 --> 00:14:52.203
People die,

00:14:52.238 --> 00:14:56.884
...but they are reborn inside human hearts
where they keep living eternally.

00:14:58.451 --> 00:14:59.463
Anthony...!

00:15:12.753 --> 00:15:15.468
What good does it make if you're
living in my heart, Anthony?

00:15:18.717 --> 00:15:21.680
I want to hear your voice.

00:15:21.715 --> 00:15:23.572
I want to see the sparkle in your eyes.

00:15:24.306 --> 00:15:26.103
I want to hold your hand, Anthony!

00:15:43.551 --> 00:15:44.830
Mr. Albert!

00:15:45.863 --> 00:15:49.427
What's up with that face?
Is that the Candy I know?

00:15:49.798 --> 00:15:54.305
Anthony.. Anthony died!
He died!

00:16:01.763 --> 00:16:03.353
You liked that boy, didn't you?

00:16:04.057 --> 00:16:07.987
We loved each other
from the very first moment.

00:16:08.802 --> 00:16:10.321
He was so kind to me!

00:16:11.447 --> 00:16:15.229
And he have his love to you?
He gave you his kindness?

00:16:16.979 --> 00:16:19.334
That's right. That's why...

00:16:19.369 --> 00:16:21.947
...even if I have to
forget him, I don't want to!

00:16:22.860 --> 00:16:26.580
Candy, what do you plan to do from now on?

00:16:27.649 --> 00:16:32.468
Don't say that this weepy, hesitant face
is all that's left of you now.

00:16:34.554 --> 00:16:39.805
Candy, do you intend to spend the rest
of your life crying over memories of him?

00:16:40.687 --> 00:16:41.902
Mr. Albert...

00:16:43.497 --> 00:16:46.907
You're not the only one who
is living with sadness.

00:16:49.036 --> 00:16:52.289
Be strong, Candy.
Find your own path in life!

00:16:52.522 --> 00:16:54.777
Candy!

00:16:56.257 --> 00:16:58.832
They are looking for you.
I'll be on my way, then.

00:16:59.831 --> 00:17:02.294
Mr. Albert! When will I see you again?

00:17:02.925 --> 00:17:05.056
We'll see each other again
once smile returns to your face.

00:17:05.079 --> 00:17:05.869
Candy.

00:17:20.661 --> 00:17:21.567
Candy?

00:17:24.343 --> 00:17:26.847
I'm sorry.
I'm alright now.

00:17:26.998 --> 00:17:30.094
-Candy!
-I see a smile, Candy!

00:17:30.399 --> 00:17:32.483
It's much better this way!
Much better, Candy!

00:17:33.489 --> 00:17:37.145
Candy, I'm sorry... I made you
go through your painful memories.

00:17:38.337 --> 00:17:43.279
It's my fault for not letting go.
But I'll be stronger from now on!

00:17:43.280 --> 00:17:45.305
You won't have to worry about
me anymore!

00:17:45.913 --> 00:17:49.551
You first need to have fun
before you can forget sad things!

00:17:53.706 --> 00:17:56.509
Now, everybody, come here! Dance, dance!

00:17:57.049 --> 00:17:57.992
Now, Candy!

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:10.036
That's the spirit, Candy!
Dance! Dance!

00:18:19.085 --> 00:18:23.210
-Archie, I'm going to tell her.
-Alright.

00:18:27.851 --> 00:18:32.715
Candy, it might surprise you,
but we're going to England.

00:18:33.787 --> 00:18:34.902
To England?

00:18:40.156 --> 00:18:43.647
With you and Anthony gone, our
house became totally boring!

00:18:44.391 --> 00:18:46.004
So that's why you're going to England?

00:18:47.495 --> 00:18:49.476
Also to find our own paths in life.

00:18:50.113 --> 00:18:51.335
Own paths...

00:18:51.531 --> 00:18:56.960
-But Candy, I'm sure we'll meet again.
-Yes, someday.

00:18:57.801 --> 00:18:59.991
Now, smile, Candy!

00:19:40.786 --> 00:19:43.872
Your fate is something you
build with your own hands.

00:19:44.296 --> 00:19:47.806
So that's the reason Stear
and Archie are going to England.

00:19:48.443 --> 00:19:50.109
And just what will I do...

00:19:50.536 --> 00:19:53.628
Boss, will you take us
on a trip once again?

00:19:54.474 --> 00:19:55.482
Can do!

00:19:59.345 --> 00:20:01.301
You were awake!

00:20:01.336 --> 00:20:05.281
How could they sleep, anyway?
Boss, banzai!

00:20:06.130 --> 00:20:07.851
Banzai!

00:20:08.041 --> 00:20:11.128
Alright, since you're awake,
I don't have to drive slowly.

00:20:11.541 --> 00:20:13.954
Okay? We'll make a run for it
towards Pony's home!

00:20:31.205 --> 00:20:33.158
Everybody needs me.

00:20:34.211 --> 00:20:35.590
They depend on me.

00:20:36.674 --> 00:20:39.675
How come I haven't noticed this before?

00:20:40.920 --> 00:20:45.667
I want to be a helper of sister Pony
and sister Lane.

00:20:46.651 --> 00:20:50.582
And to stay at Pony's home, taking
care of all the children!

00:20:57.659 --> 00:21:02.667
Candy realized
what she wanted to do in her life.

00:21:17.428 --> 00:21:20.295
To be continued...
